{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>For He has brought low.</b> Doubled forms, like <i>he brings low</i> in הִקְלָה אַרְצָה זְבוּלוּן (Isaiah 8:23 [MT 9:1]). The meaning: upon the provinces of the nations." "<b>He will bring it low, bringing it low.</b> Like עֻזִּי וּמָעֻזִּי (Jeremiah 16:19). The meaning: continually."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:11.227187740Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}